sequenceDiagram
  participant Q as Waiting queue
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant G as GPU
  participant U as Users
  loop Every step
    Note over S: 1. One decode token per running request
    Q->>S: 2. Admit requests while KV memory is free
    Note over S: 3. Fill leftover token budget with prompt chunks
    S->>G: 4. One forward pass on the mixed batch
    G->>U: 5. Stream each request's new token
    Note over S,G: 6. Evict finished requests and free their KV
  end
